{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495999,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T02:03:21.847Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495999-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495999-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFeature request for product/service\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e– Other –\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495999-describe-the-request-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495999-describe-the-request-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the request\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCurrent:\u003c/strong\u003e Plugin account rows label the connected account as “default” (e.g. Vercel Accounts shows \u003ccode\u003edefault · Connected\u003c/code\u003e). There is no email, username, or team/slug, so it is impossible to tell which Vercel (or other provider) account is linked when multiple accounts exist or after re-auth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAsk:\u003c/strong\u003e Show a human-readable identity from the provider (email, username, or org/team slug) on each account row, keeping Connected status. Optional: tap for full account details.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy:\u003c/strong\u003e Multi-account / re-connect flows; user cannot verify the right account is bound.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvidence:\u003c/strong\u003e Screenshot of Vercel Accounts row showing \u003ccode\u003edefault · Connected\u003c/code\u003e (attached).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironment:\u003c/strong\u003e Grok Bot 1.11.1 (11669) iOS · runtime d025c009e37d599fc420b10b990bf540e68ca7fc · embedded · production. Conversation ID: Gap — not provided (iOS). Surface: iOS. Marketplace plugin: Vercel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn-app SendFeedback also submitted for this report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495999-screenshot-screen-recording-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495999-screenshot-screen-recording-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshot / Screen Recording\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/f/dfadba58b5c4a7e8c184da6d47522035b30e3262.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/vUKGxXuup3O5XRLpkVTlpnOI62K.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"account-default.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/f/dfadba58b5c4a7e8c184da6d47522035b30e3262_2_690x447.jpeg\" alt=\"account-default.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"vUKGxXuup3O5XRLpkVTlpnOI62K\" width=\"690\" height=\"447\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/f/dfadba58b5c4a7e8c184da6d47522035b30e3262_2_690x447.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/f/dfadba58b5c4a7e8c184da6d47522035b30e3262_2_1035x670.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/f/dfadba58b5c4a7e8c184da6d47522035b30e3262.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1C1C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eaccount-default.jpg\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1170×759 42.5 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-20T08:32:40.169Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":5.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172381,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-sh